Error: Jet.MethodInTag: The tag `Reviewed` declares a method `review`, but tags have no methods
  --> Tests/UI/tag_marker_with_method.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     review: fn(self) -> Int { 1 }
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: A value tag is a field-less struct that erases at runtime; only a `trait` carries methods and dispatches
 Fix: Make `Reviewed` a `trait` if `review` should dispatch, or remove the method to keep `Reviewed` a value tag
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.MethodInTag
